{"id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-compositional-axioms.md","title":"组合公理","display":"df-compositional-axioms — 组合公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-compositional-axioms","aliases":["91-df-compositional-axioms"],"display":"df-compositional-axioms — 组合公理","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-compositional-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-compositional-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compositional-axioms — 组合公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-compositional-axioms-—-组合公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}$\">df-compositional-axioms — 组合公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\\)</span> (基础语言句子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\">\\(\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\\)</span> (含至多一个自由变量的基础语言公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言闭项)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},n)\\)</span> (数字代入后的句子编码项,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner s=t\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow(s=t),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\lor T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\theta(x)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},n)),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\exists x\\,\\theta(x)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},n))\n\\end{array}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{array}{l}\ns,t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\\\n\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner s=t\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow(s=t),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\lor T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\theta(x)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},n)),\\\\\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\exists x\\,\\theta(x)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},n))\n\\end{array}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{array}{l}\ns,t\\in\\mathrm{CTerm}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\\\\n\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\)</span> : 组合公理集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land, \\lor, \\neg, \\forall, \\exists\">\\(\\land, \\lor, \\neg, \\forall, \\exists\\)</span> : 逻辑联结词和量词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}(\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}(\\cdot)\\)</span> : 扩展语言句子谓词</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：组合公理规定真理谓词如何与逻辑联结词交互。基本思想是&quot;真理是组合的&quot;：复合句子的真值由其组成部分的真值决定。</p>\n<p>各公理含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>合取公理</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\land \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\land \\psi\\)</span>是真的，当且仅当<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是真的且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>是真的</li>\n<li><strong>析取公理</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\lor \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\lor \\psi\\)</span>是真的，当且仅当<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是真的或<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>是真的</li>\n<li><strong>否定公理</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg \\varphi\">\\(\\neg \\varphi\\)</span>是真的，当且仅当<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>不是真的</li>\n<li><strong>全称公理</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\, \\varphi(x)\">\\(\\forall x\\, \\varphi(x)\\)</span>是真的，当且仅当对所有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>是真的</li>\n<li><strong>存在公理</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\, \\varphi(x)\">\\(\\exists x\\, \\varphi(x)\\)</span>是真的，当且仅当存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>使得<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>是真的</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些经典双条件直接适用于基础语言的组合真理理论。FS 采用相应组合\n原则并配合捕获/释放规则；KF 则以经典外部逻辑公理化强 Kleene 真理\n条件，尤其必须区分\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span> 与外部否定\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>。不能把 KF 简化成“只对正公式\n使用上述经典否定双条件”，也不能因此把 KF 的背景演绎逻辑说成部分逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-compositional-axioms-—-组合公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}$","text":"df-compositional-axioms — 组合公理 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}$ (基础语言句子, see [[91-df-ground-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"r